# Pakai ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code. Jalankan dari atas ke bawah.
# Prasyarat: akun admin sudah dibuat (lihat README: "Menjadikan akun sebagai admin")
# dan data contoh sudah diisi (seed.sql).

@auth = http://localhost:8081
@host = http://localhost:8082

# Variabel diambil otomatis dari respons request bernama (# @name ...).
# Penting: definisi variabel HARUS di sini (atas file), bukan di bawah body request,
# karena baris apa pun di bawah body dianggap bagian dari body sampai bertemu "###".
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.access_token}}
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.access_token}}
@newId = {{created.response.body.id}}

### Login admin (ganti email/password sesuai akun yang Anda jadikan admin)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "andi@example.com", "password": "rahasia123" }


### Register dan login pelanggan biasa (untuk menguji 403)
POST {{auth}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi@example.com", "password": "rahasia123" }

###
# @name userLogin
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi@example.com", "password": "rahasia123" }


### ---------- PUBLIK ----------

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Daftar produk (halaman 1, 12 per halaman)
GET {{host}}/products

### Pencarian
GET {{host}}/products?q=jamu

### Filter kategori + urut harga termurah
GET {{host}}/products?category=madu&sort=price_asc

### Paginasi
GET {{host}}/products?page=2&limit=5

### Kategori
GET {{host}}/categories

### Detail produk
GET {{host}}/products/1

### Produk tidak ada (harus 404)
GET {{host}}/products/99999

### ---------- ADMIN ----------

### Tambah produk
# @name created
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Wedang Uwuh", "description": "Minuman rempah hangat.", "category": "jamu", "price": 20000, "stock": 25 }


### Ubah produk
PUT {{host}}/products/{{newId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Wedang Uwuh Premium", "description": "Minuman rempah hangat.", "category": "jamu", "price": 22000, "stock": 20 }

### Unggah gambar. Taruh file contoh.jpg di folder product-service/ (JPEG/PNG/WebP, maks 2 MB).
POST {{host}}/products/{{newId}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----TokoHerbal

------TokoHerbal
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="contoh.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./contoh.jpg
------TokoHerbal--

### Hapus produk (204)
DELETE {{host}}/products/{{newId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------- PENOLAKAN YANG HARUS TERJADI ----------

### Tanpa token (harus 401)
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "category": "jamu", "price": 1000, "stock": 1 }

### Token pelanggan biasa (harus 403)
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "category": "jamu", "price": 1000, "stock": 1 }

### Harga negatif (harus 400)
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "category": "jamu", "price": -1, "stock": 1 }

### Field tak dikenal (harus 400)
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "category": "jamu", "price": 1000, "stock": 1, "id": 5 }
